          "solution": "$a_1=(1,1)^T$：$q_1=\\dfrac{a_1}{\\|a_1\\|}=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt2}(1,1)^T$，$r_{11}=\\|a_1\\|=\\sqrt2$，$r_{12}=q_1^Ta_2=\\dfrac{1+0}{\\sqrt2}=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt2}$。$a_2-r_{12}q_1=(1,0)^T-\\dfrac{1}{2}(1,1)^T=\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2},-\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)^T$，$r_{22}=\\sqrt{\\dfrac{1}{4}+\\dfrac{1}{4}}=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt2}$，$q_2=\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2},-\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)^T\\Big/\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt2}=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt2}(1,-1)^T$。故 $A=QR$，其中 $Q=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt2}\\begin{pmatrix}1&1\\\\1&-1\\end{pmatrix}$，$R=\\begin{pmatrix}\\sqrt2&\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}\\\\0&\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}\\end{pmatrix}$。验证：$QR=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt2}\\begin{pmatrix}1&1\\\\1&-1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}\\sqrt2&\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}\\\\0&\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1\\\\1&0\\end{pmatrix}$。",
