          "solution": "$A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1\\\\2&1\\\\3&1\\end{pmatrix}$，$\\vec b=(2,4,7)^T$。法方程 $A^TA\\vec x=A^T\\vec b$：$A^TA=\\begin{pmatrix}14&6\\\\6&3\\end{pmatrix}$，$A^T\\vec b=\\begin{pmatrix}31\\\\13\\end{pmatrix}$。解 $\\begin{cases}14a+6b=31\\\\6a+3b=13\\end{cases}$：由第二式 $2a+b=\\dfrac{13}{3}$，$b=\\dfrac{13}{3}-2a$。代入第一式：$14a+6\\left(\\dfrac{13}{3}-2a\\right)=31$，即 $14a+26-12a=31$，$2a=5$，$a=\\dfrac{5}{2}$，$b=\\dfrac{13}{3}-5=-\\dfrac{2}{3}$。拟合直线 $y=\\dfrac{5}{2}x-\\dfrac{2}{3}$。验证：$x=1,2,3$ 时预测值 $\\dfrac{11}{6},\\dfrac{13}{3},\\dfrac{41}{6}$，残差平方和 $\\left(\\dfrac{1}{6}\\right)^2+\\left(-\\dfrac{1}{3}\\right)^2+\\left(\\dfrac{1}{6}\\right)^2=\\dfrac{1}{6}$。",
